flowchart LR
  SOURCE[Caption source] --> STATE[CaptionState: latest provisional per segment and finalized IDs / revisions]
  subgraph SERVER[Server: one asyncio event loop]
    STATE -->|finals| HISTORY[History: full final captions, 90 s / 5000 items]
    STATE --> POLICY[Broadcast and per-client overload policy]
    STATE -. active snapshot .-> JOIN[RecoveryPlan: bounded snapshot, HISTORY batches up to 1 MiB]
    HISTORY -. recovery .-> JOIN
    subgraph SESSIONS[Independent client sessions: cleanup and monitoring]
      NORMAL[NORMAL FIFO: 256 messages / 1 MiB] --> SCHED[Scheduler: FIFO or finals first with active turns]
      FINAL[DEGRADED final/control FIFO: 256 messages / 1 MiB] --> SCHED
      ACTIVE[DEGRADED active map: 1000 segments / 1 MiB] --> SCHED
      SCHED --> TX[One sender per client: recovery prefix then scheduler]
    end
    POLICY -->|NORMAL| NORMAL
    POLICY -->|DEGRADED| FINAL
    POLICY -->|DEGRADED| ACTIVE
    JOIN -. bounded recovery prefix .-> TX
  end
  TX --> BROWSER[Each browser: revision checks, live view and final recall]
  BROWSER -. HELLO and final cursor .-> JOIN
